      "index": 125,
      "time": "2026/10/26 11:12:34",
      "role": "本人",
      "text": "我觉得。\n（发言 stream:qwen:67dbf8dc-585d-4b72-9eb4-1d1400b7deaa:you:67dbf8dc-585d-4b72-9eb4-1d1400b7deaa:128 · 版本 3）"
